      <description><![CDATA[
<h4>Permissions and the helper now survive updates</h4>
<p>eWiz is now signed with its own certificate instead of a one-off signature, so macOS keeps Bluetooth and other permissions across updates, and the helper updates itself without asking for your password. The first update after this one asks once more; later ones don't.</p>
      ]]></description>
